solute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors lg:not-machine:hidden"></div><div><div><p><strong class="font-medium machine:font-normal"><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre">**</span>How it works<span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre">**</span></strong></p><p>If your organization already has a card added, there’s nothing you need to do. Each month, your organization receives a new credit. Any unused balance expires at the end of the month.</p><p>Use it to try Parallel, power OpenClaw or Hermes agents, run daily research, prototype a product, or build something of your own. If you use more than $5, additional usage is billed to your card at standard rates.</p><p>Each eligible organization can receive one $5 monthly credit. A payment card can be used to activate monthly credits for one organization only. Marketplace and postpaid organizations are not currently eligible.</p></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors lg:not-machine:hidden"></div></div><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full lg:col-span-6 md:col-start-4 lg:col-start-4 prose-article my-(--space-16)"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors lg:not-machine:hidden"></div><div><div><h2><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre">##<!-- --> </span>What $5 covers</h2><p>Parallel prices each request upfront, so you know the cost before it runs. At current prices, $5 covers up to:</p><ul><li><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre">-<!-- --> </span>5,000 Search API requests</li><li><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre">-<!-- --> </span>5,000 Extract API requests</li><li><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre">-<!-- --> </span>1,000 Task API runs</li><li><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre">-<!-- --> </span>1,666 Monitor API executions</li></ul><p>Or any combination of the above.</p></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors lg:not-machine:hidden"></div></div><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full lg:col-span-6 md:col-start-4 lg:col-start-4 prose-article my-(--space-16)"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors lg:not-machine:hidden"></div><div><div><h2><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre">##<!-- --> </span>Get started</h2><p>Sign up at <a class="machine:hidden group text-brand hover:underline" href="https://platform.parallel.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">platform.parallel.ai</a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre text-body-sm group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden ">[<!-- -->platform.parallel.ai<!-- -->]<span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai<!-- -->)</span></a></span> to start building.  Visit our <a class="machine:hidden group text-brand hover:underline" href="https://parallel.ai/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">pricing page</a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre text-body-sm group"><a href="/ai/pricing" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden ">[<!-- -->pricing page<!-- -->]<span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->/pricing<!-- -->)</span></a></span> for the full breakdown.</p></div></div><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -right-[calc(var(--space-h-bracket)_+_0px)] top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors lg:not-machine:hidden"></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-(--space-48) grid-cols-12 px-(--space-24) overflow-x-clip py-(--space-40) pw-home pipeline machine:pt-(--space-24)"><div class="relative col-start-1 col-span-full"><div data-rail="" class="h-full absolute -left-(--space-h-bracket) top-0 w-[1px] bg-[var(--color-stroke-primary)] transition-mode-colors"></div><div><div><div class="not-machine:hidden flex flex-col gap-(--space-8)"><h2 class="text-title-sm text-primary m-0"><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre">##<!-- --> </span>Ready to get started? </h2><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-(--space-8)"><span class="contents"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/home" target="_self" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-8)_-_1px)] uppercase motion-safe:active:scale-[0.98] text-white bg-brand hover:bg-brand-hover border-transparent active:bg-brand disabled:bg-surface-tag text-body-sm machine:hidden"><span class="flex items-center gap-2">Start building for free</span></a><span class="not-machine:hidden whitespace-pre inline-block pb-[2px] text-invert text-body-sm bg-surface-secondary group"><a href="https://platform.parallel.ai/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="no-underline group-hover:underline group-hover:decoration-brand overflow-hidden "><span class="uppercase">[<!-- -->Start building for free<!-- -->]</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80">(<!-- -->https://platform.parallel.ai/home<!-- -->)</span></a></span></span><span class="contents"><span class="not-machine:hidden"> </span><a href="https://contact.parallel.ai/" target="_self" class="font-mono rounded-sm border px-(--space-16) inline-block transition-[color,background-color,border-color,scale] ease-out cursor-pointer pt-[calc(var(--space-8)_+_1px)] pb-[calc(var(--space-