:57Z\",\"_id\":\"the-outside-world-is-the-new-infrastructure\",\"_type\":\"blogArticle\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-09-28T19:08:57Z\",\"author\":{\"avatar\":{\"_type\":\"image\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-bc129d6f380d79081f915b3b6391b33ff4adf0ed-512x512-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"name\":\"Liam Mulcahy\"},\"coAuthors\":null,\"coverImage\":{\"_type\":\"image\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-d26efc6cac63969c577ac08d2b514de321a3b68b-3840x2306-webp\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"hideAuthorImage\":true,\"intro\":\"The last infrastructure cycle made companies smarter about their own infrastructure. The next one is turning everything outside the firewall into machine infrastructure.\",\"publishedAt\":null,\"slug\":\"the-outside-world-is-the-new-infrastructure\",\"tags\":[{\"_key\":\"company\",\"_type\":\"tag\",\"label\":\"Company\",\"value\":\"company\"}],\"title\":\"The outside world is the new infrastructure\"}}]}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"$L24\",\"cookbook-gemini-parallel-enrichment\",{\"cols\":3,\"className\":\"lg:col-start-auto lg:-ml-[1px]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L68\",\"cookbook-gemini-parallel-enrichment\",{\"post\":{\"_createdAt\":\"2026-09-14T23:59:26Z\",\"_id\":\"cookbook-gemini-parallel-enrichment\",\"_type\":\"blogArticle\",\"_updatedAt\":\"2026-09-30T18:38:25Z\",\"author\":{\"avatar\":{\"_type\":\"image\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-9c284d972fc3ee6b8b8f5abb01e8d18ef874cbbe-512x512-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"name\":\"George Pickett\"},\"coAuthors\":null,\"coverImage\":{\"_type\":\"image\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-6d2b3ee6fc07a903538f536af030116e24ba8969-5396x3240-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"hideAuthorImage\":true,\"intro\":\"This cookbook fills missing company, people, and product fields with Gemini and Parallel Web Search, using Google's Python SDK and Pydantic. Two model calls produce a typed record with citations, and a short Python check confirms identity, provenance, and coverage before you store it.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-28T14:00:00.000Z\",\"slu